*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FRD0026
*> PURPOSE : FRAUD SCORING RULES
*> AUTHOR  : J.K.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1987-05-11 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-11-01 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 289
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FRDNIGHT STEP070
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FRD0026.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    COPY FRD0026C.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    05 RISK-LVL           PIC X VALUE 'L'.
    *> FRAUD RISK SCORE
    05 FRAUD-SCORE        PIC 9(3) VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM RATE-ACTIVITY
    DISPLAY "RISK-LVL=" RISK-LVL
    DISPLAY "FRAUD-SCORE=" FRAUD-SCORE
    STOP RUN.
RATE-ACTIVITY.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        WHEN TXN-COUNT-24H > 15 AND TRAN-AMT > 4000
            MOVE 'H' TO RISK-LVL
            MOVE 90 TO FRAUD-SCORE
        *> ELEVATED TRANSACTION VELOCITY
        WHEN TXN-COUNT-24H > 6
            MOVE 'M' TO RISK-LVL
            MOVE 60 TO FRAUD-SCORE
        *> ACTIVITY ON NEW ACCOUNT
        WHEN ACCT-OPEN-DAYS < 90
            MOVE 'M' TO RISK-LVL
            MOVE 40 TO FRAUD-SCORE
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 'L' TO RISK-LVL
            MOVE 10 TO FRAUD-SCORE
    END-EVALUATE.
